{
  "executionPlatform": "Camunda Cloud",
  "executionPlatformVersion": "8.6.0",
  "exporter": {
    "name": "Camunda Web Modeler",
    "version": "64767e4"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 16,
  "id": "review-failed-payout",
  "components": [
    {
      "id": "Field_intro",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_intro"
      },
      "text": "## Review the failed payout\n\nProducer **{{settlement.producerName}}** ({{settlement.producerId}}) in run **{{settlementRunId}}**. Amount: **£{{string(floor(floor(settlement.netAmount * 100 + 0.5) / 100)) + \".\" + substring(string(floor(settlement.netAmount * 100 + 0.5) - floor(floor(settlement.netAmount * 100 + 0.5) / 100) * 100 + 100), 2)}}**. Attempt: **{{payoutAttempt}}**.\n\nResult from the payment service: **{{payoutStatus}}**. Reason: **{{if failureReason = null then \"None given\" else failureReason}}**."
    },
    {
      "id": "Field_help",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_help"
      },
      "text": "A retry sends a new payout with a new attempt number. Hold the payout if the problem needs more time to correct, for example a closed account. The next run then includes the balance again."
    },
    {
      "id": "Field_retryDecision",
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "retryDecision",
      "label": "What do you want to do?",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_decision"
      },
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "Try the payout again",
          "value": "RETRY"
        },
        {
          "label": "Hold the payout for next week's run",
          "value": "HOLD"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Field_reviewNote",
      "type": "textarea",
      "key": "reviewNote",
      "label": "Note for the audit trail",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_note"
      },
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      }
    }
  ],
  "type": "default"
}